       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.
           TMNSTRRN.
       AUTHOR.
           KURT MOVSESIAN.
      *REMARKS.
      *
      **************************************************************
      *                                                            *
      *   T M N S T R R N    THIS PROGRAM RENAMES THE MANIFEST     *
      *     STORES FILES 'MANSTR(nn)' TO  'MANSTR(nn-1)' WHERE     *
      *     'nn' IS THE TOTAL NUMBER OF LOCAL STORES FILES         *
      *      THIS PROGRAM IS RAN AFTER A SUCCESSFUL SEND FOR THE   *
      *      LOCAL STORES ACCOUNTING FILE.                         *
      *                                                            *
      *      FILE DEFINITIONS                                      *
      *                                                            *
      *        1) MANSTR01 - THE LOCAL STORES FILE THAT WAS JUST   *
      *                      SENT AND WAS RENAME TO DSTACT01.      *
      *                     SYSTEMS.  THIS FILE IS ONLY CREATED    *
      *                     WHEN THE 'RLSE' MANIFEST OPTION IS     *
      *                     SELECTED.                              *
      *        2) MANSTRnn - THE MUST CURRENT LOCAL STORES         *
      *                      ACCOUNTING FILE.                      *
      *                      TO CREATE THE AKRON MANIFEST FILE     *
      *                                                            *
      **************************************************************
      *C
      *C   28FEB1994    DAVE PLUM
      *C     ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER - MCXCBLERR.
      *C
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.

       DATA DIVISION.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  MCXCBLERR-SCOPE            PIC X(1)  VALUE "C".

       01  COMMAND-AREA.
           05  QCMDEXC-MANSTR.
               10  RNMOBJ-MANSTR      PIC X(70) VALUE SPACES.
               10  DBF-MANSTR-PARM2 PIC S9(10)V9(5) COMP-3 VALUE 70.

       COPY CCHKOBJ  IN COPYLIB.

       01  LISTF-COMMAND.
           05  FILLER  PIC X(6)  VALUE "LISTF ".
           05  LISTF-FNAME  PIC X(8)  VALUE SPACES.

       01  RENAME-COMMAND.
           05  FILLER  PIC X(7)  VALUE "RENAME ".
           05  OLD-FNAME  PIC X(8) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER  PIC X VALUE ",".
           05  NEW-FNAME  PIC X(8)  VALUE SPACES.

       01  MAN-STR-FILE-PLUS-1.
           05  FILLER      PIC X(6) VALUE "MANSTR".
           05  MAN-STR-CTR-1    PIC 9(2)  VALUE ZEROS.
           05  FILLER      PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.

       01  MAN-STR-FILE.
           05  FILLER      PIC X(6) VALUE "MANSTR".
           05  MAN-STR-CTR    PIC 9(2)  VALUE ZEROS.
           05  FILLER      PIC X(2) VALUE SPACES.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       PROC-DIV SECTION 01.

       1-BEGIN.
           MOVE "C" TO MCXCBLERR-SCOPE.
           CALL "MCXCBLERR" USING MCXCBLERR-SCOPE.

           PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-M-X.

           GOBACK.

      **************************************************
      *                                                *
      *     6 - M A I N                                *
      *                                                *
      **************************************************

       6-MAIN.
           MOVE ZERO                 TO  MAN-STR-CTR.
           MOVE 1                    TO  MAN-STR-CTR-1.
           MOVE MAN-STR-FILE-PLUS-1  TO  CHKOBJ-FILE-NAME.
           CALL "CCHKOBJ" USING CHKOBJ-FILE-NAME,
                                CHKOBJ-RETURN-STATUS.
           IF CHKOBJ-RETURN-STATUS  NOT = "00"
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               DISPLAY "STORES FILE 1 EXISTS FATAL ERROR"
               GO TO 6-M-X.

       6-RENAME-LOOP.
           ADD 1      TO  MAN-STR-CTR,
                          MAN-STR-CTR-1.
           IF MAN-STR-CTR-1 = 99
               DISPLAY "MANIFEST STORES FILE GEN=99"
               GO TO 6-M-X.

           MOVE MAN-STR-FILE-PLUS-1  TO  CHKOBJ-FILE-NAME.
           CALL "CCHKOBJ" USING CHKOBJ-FILE-NAME,
                                CHKOBJ-RETURN-STATUS.
           IF CHKOBJ-RETURN-STATUS  NOT = "00"
               GO TO 6-M-X.

           CALL "MCXRENAM" USING MAN-STR-FILE-PLUS-1, MAN-STR-FILE.
      *    STRING "RNMOBJ OBJ(", MAN-STR-FILE-PLUS-1, ")
      *     "OBJTYPE(*FILE) NEWOBJ(", MAN-STR-FILE, ")"
      *      DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO RNMOBJ-MANSTR.
      *    CALL "QCMDEXC" USING RNMOBJ-MANSTR, DBF-MANSTR-PARM2.
      *    STRING "RNMM FILE(", MAN-STR-FILE, ") MBR
      *     "(", MAN-STR-FILE-PLUS-1, ") NEWMBR(", MAN-STR-FILE, ")"
      *      DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO RNMOBJ-MANSTR.
      *    CALL "QCMDEXC" USING RNMOBJ-MANSTR, DBF-MANSTR-PARM2.
           GO TO 6-RENAME-LOOP.

       6-M-X.
           EXIT.
